{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1692-p4","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"选自《雪莱诗选》（时代文艺出版社2012 年版）。江枫译。雪莱（1792—1822），英国诗人。代表作有诗歌《西风颂》、诗剧《解放了的普罗米修斯》等。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11124-8"}],"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"致云雀","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-11124-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"\n\n雪莱","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"你好啊，欢乐的精灵！\n\n你似乎从不是飞禽，\n\n从天堂或天堂的邻近，\n\n以酣畅淋漓的乐音，\n\n不事雕琢的艺术，倾吐你的衷心。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"向上，再向高处飞翔，\n\n从地面你一跃而上，\n\n像一片烈火的轻云，\n\n掠过蔚蓝的天心，\n\n永远歌唱着飞翔，飞翔着歌唱。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"地平线下的太阳，\n\n放射出金色的电光，\n\n晴空里霞蔚云蒸，\n\n你沐浴着明光飞行，\n\n似不具形体的喜悦开始迅疾的远征。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"淡淡的紫色黄昏\n\n在你航程周围消融。\n\n像昼空里的星星。\n\n虽然不见形影，\n\n却可以听得清你那欢乐的强音——","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"那犀利无比的乐音，\n\n似银色星光的利箭，\n\n它那强烈的明灯，\n\n在晨曦中逐渐暗淡。\n\n以至难以分辨，却能感觉到就在空间。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"整个大地和大气，\n\n响彻你婉转的歌喉，\n\n仿佛在荒凉的黑夜，\n\n从一片孤云背后，\n\n明月放射出光芒，清辉洋溢遍宇宙。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"我们不知，你是什么，\n\n什么和你最为相似？\n\n从霓虹似的彩霞\n\n也降不下这样美的雨，\n\n能和你出现时降下的乐曲甘霖相比。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"像一位诗人，隐身\n\n在思想的明辉之中，\n\n吟诵着即兴的诗韵，\n\n直到普天下的同情\n\n都被未曾留意过的希望和忧虑唤醒；","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"像一位高贵的少女，\n\n居住在深宫的楼台，\n\n在寂寞难言的时刻，\n\n排遣为爱所苦的情怀，\n\n甜美有如爱情的歌曲，溢出闺阁之外；","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"像一只金色的萤火虫，\n\n在凝露的深山幽谷，\n\n不显露它的行止影踪，\n\n把晶莹的流光传播，\n\n在遮断我们视线的芳草鲜花丛中；","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"像一朵让自己的绿叶\n\n荫蔽着的玫瑰，\n\n遭受到热风的摧残，\n\n以至它的芳菲\n\n以过浓的香甜使鲁莽的飞贼沉醉；","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"晶莹闪烁的草地，\n\n春霖洒落的声息，\n\n雨后苏醒的花蕾，\n\n称得上明朗、欢悦、\n\n清新的一切，全都不及你的音乐。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"飞禽或是精灵，有什么\n\n甜美的思绪在你心头？\n\n我从来还没有听到过\n\n爱情或是醇酒的颂歌\n\n能够迸涌出这样神圣的极乐音流。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"赞婚的合唱也罢，\n\n凯旋的欢歌也罢，\n\n和你的乐声相比，\n\n不过是空洞的浮夸。\n\n人们可以觉察，其中总有着贫乏。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"什么样的物象或事件，\n\n是你欢乐乐曲的源泉？\n\n什么田野、波涛、山峦？\n\n什么空中陆上的形态？\n\n是你对同类的爱，还是对痛苦的绝缘？","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"有你明澈强烈的欢快，\n\n倦怠永不会出现，\n\n那烦恼的阴影，从来\n\n近不得你的身边，\n\n你爱，却从不知晓过分充满爱的悲哀。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"是醒来，抑或是睡去，\n\n你对死的理解一定比\n\n我们凡人梦想到的\n\n更加深刻真切，否则\n\n你的乐曲音流怎能像液态的水晶涌泻？","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"我们瞻前顾后，为了\n\n不存在的事物自扰，\n\n我们最真挚的欢笑，\n\n也交织着某种苦恼，\n\n我们最美的音乐是最能倾诉哀思的曲调。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"可是，即使我们能摈弃\n\n憎恨、傲慢和恐惧，\n\n即使我们生来不会\n\n抛洒任何一滴眼泪，\n\n我也不知，怎能接近于你的欢愉。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"比一切欢乐的音律\n\n更加甜蜜美妙，\n\n比一切书中的宝库\n\n更加丰盛富饶。\n\n这就是鄙弃尘土的你啊你的艺术技巧。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"教给我一半，你的心\n\n必定熟知的欢欣，\n\n和谐、炽热的激情\n\n就会流出我的双唇，\n\n全世界就会像此刻的我——侧耳倾听。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"1820 年夏","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":"11124-4","sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"5487243dd8d14d65dfadc20ed544a999aaa318fc20c291462ea62c69e1eff320","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-07-30.2","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-1","postId":"11124-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-2","postId":"11124-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-3","postId":"11124-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-3","text":"[3]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-4","postId":"11124-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-4","text":"[4]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-5","postId":"11124-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-5","text":"[5]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-6","postId":"11124-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-6","text":"[6]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-7","postId":"11124-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-7","text":"[7]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-8","postId":"11124-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11124-8","text":"[8]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-1","postId":"11124-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-1","text":"↩︎","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-2","postId":"11124-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-2","text":"↩︎","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-3","postId":"11124-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-3","text":"↩︎","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-4","postId":"11124-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-4","text":"↩︎","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-5","postId":"11124-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-5","text":"↩︎","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-6","postId":"11124-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-6","text":"↩︎","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-7","postId":"11124-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-7","text":"↩︎","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-8","postId":"11124-4","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-ref-11124-8","text":"↩︎","title":null}],"media":[],"posts":[{"cookedSha256":"db8aa73333615a9feddca2bb7f57dada3b0df4895d02b1d70d1d7fe488484c0b","createdAt":"2024-08-21T10:00:37Z","plainTextSha256":"bbbda7080c849ade5a4c03f7d1b8e9046953e2f41c7b093b5138df4f8e595ca3","postId":"11124-4","postNumber":1,"replyToPostNumber":null,"role":"primary","updatedAt":"2024-08-21T10:17:31Z"}],"roleAuditDecisions":[],"sourceLessonPath":"data/lessons/lesson-1692-p4.json","sourceLessonUpdatedAt":"2024-12-19T09:59:30Z","sourcePostCount":1},"resources":[],"roleAuditSha256":"65654ae8bd58de3c8040438da7fc213c00b7175d6dc82802a995f46c4cdfd4a7","roleAuditVersion":"2026-07-30.2","schemaVersion":"yw-reader-document-v1","supplementary":[],"title":"致云雀"}
